<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><!--
 Italian translation.

 Osmium Sound ships an Italian-first appliance (kiosk and web admin both
 default to Italian), so the companion carries a full Italian translation
 rather than falling back to the English base for most of its UI.

 Android escaping: apostrophes must be \' and ampersands &amp;. Format
 specifiers (%s, %1$s, %d, %1$.1f) must survive translation unchanged and in a
 quantity that matches the base string.
-->
